# The build needs no secrets today. Copy this file to `.env` if that changes.
#
# Anything prefixed with PUBLIC_ is inlined into the built HTML and is visible to
# every visitor. Never put a private key behind a PUBLIC_ name.
#
# Server-side secrets (Stripe keys, webhook signing secrets) do NOT belong here.
# They are Cloudflare Worker secrets, set with:
#   npx wrangler secret put STRIPE_SECRET_KEY --env ""
#
# Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon token. Public by design; production only.
# PUBLIC_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=
